<title>USA: Moody's raises Hartford, Wis., bonds to single-A.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Hartford, Wis., bonds to single-A.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Sept 27 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating</p>
<p>Announcement As of 09/17/96.</p>
<p>Issuer		: Hartford</p>
<p>State		 : WI</p>
<p>Rating		: A</p>
<p>Sale Amount	 : 3,690,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 09/18/96</p>
</text>
